+# Local verification and CI policy
+
+No GitHub Actions runs are requested for this development continuation.
+Use the CMake/CTest commands in BUILD.md and tests/README.md locally. The existing
+workflow definitions remain available, but preserving them does not mean that
+they were executed or passed. A branch commit is not approval to merge master.
+
+The development branches do not match the existing push filters, and publication
+commits use `[skip ci]`. Do not open a PR targeting master or dispatch workflows
+while the user's no-Actions instruction remains in effect.
diff --git a/docs/DependencyAudit.md b/docs/DependencyAudit.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5181691
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/DependencyAudit.md
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# Dependency and toolchain status — checked 2026-09-07
+
+| Component | Current upstream release checked | This tree / verification status |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| CMake | 4.4.3 | Explicit installer pins updated to 4.4.3; minimum supported version remains 3.30. Local builds used 3.31.6, not 4.4.3. |
+| LLVM / Clang | 23.1.0 | Current-toolchain profile requires this floor. Local compiler was Clang 17. |
+| GCC | 16.2 | Current-toolchain profile requires this floor. Local comparison used GCC 14.2. |
+| C / C++ | C23 / C++26 mode | Core and maintained Teakra build in the configured dialect. This is not a claim of full C++26 implementation support. |
+| vcpkg | 04a9d8e5212d01ee1dd9478eadd9caade4f8b0d4 | Registry pin already updated in the cumulative batch; packages were not reinstalled here. |
+| Qt | 6.11.2 | External current-deps profile requests this floor; registry may still supply 6.11.1. Frontend not built here. |
+| libarchive | 3.8.9 | Overlay preparation helper exists, but generation/build was not run. Do not claim this release is installed. |
+| FAAD2 | 2.11.2 | Obsolete 2.11.1 overlay removed in the cumulative batch; new package was not built here. |
+| SDL | SDL2 API retained | SDL3 requires an API migration; it is not a version-number replacement. |
+| Teakra / custom slirp / FatFs / GL loader | Project-maintained copies | Their local modifications must not be overwritten by an arbitrary upstream snapshot. |
+
+Compatibility GCC 14 / Clang 18 jobs intentionally exercise older supported toolchains. They are not the latest-toolchain profile. No workflows were executed for this continuation.
+
+A compiler mode, an installed tool, a minimum supported version, a dependency lock, an ABI version and a guest-hardware constant are different things. License numbers, save-format versions and emulated hardware constants were not changed for cosmetic version increases.
+
+Official release sources:
+- https://cmake.org/download/
+- https://www.kitware.com/cmake-4-4-3-available-for-download/
+- https://llvm.org/
+- https://gcc.gnu.org/releases.html
+- https://www.qt.io/blog/qt-6.11.2-released
+- https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/releases/tag/v3.8.9
